.el .ds Aq '
.TH create 1  "create " 
.SH NAME
create \- Create a collection
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcreate\fR [\fB\-\-description\fR] [\fB\-\-visibility\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a collection
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-description\fR \fI<DESCRIPTION>\fR
Short description
.TP
\fB\-\-visibility\fR \fI<VISIBILITY>\fR [default: private]
Collection visibility: private|unlisted|public
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
Collection name (same rules as snippet names)
